WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:04.196
Journey fourteen: track and cancel requests.

00:00:04.196 --> 00:00:09.434
A member follows each request and cancels one that is still open.

00:00:10.294 --> 00:00:15.238
Your requests lists every booking, quote and order, open ones first,

00:00:15.238 --> 00:00:17.782
with how many are awaiting a reply.

00:00:18.497 --> 00:00:22.080
The page now listens to Jubilee's event stream.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:27.112
When WaterWorks confirms, the row changes a second later, with one

00:00:27.112 --> 00:00:27.569
toast.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:32.578
A confirmed order now offers the owner Mark fulfilled.

00:00:32.578 --> 00:00:37.487
The dialog names the customer, the order and the total, with Not yet

00:00:37.487 --> 00:00:37.920
first.

00:00:38.628 --> 00:00:41.426
Marking it fulfilled closes the order.

00:00:41.426 --> 00:00:46.580
The customer is told in the app and by e-mail, and their request reads

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:47.316
Completed.

00:00:48.513 --> 00:00:52.937
A member watching their order sees it complete the moment the shop marks

00:00:52.937 --> 00:00:54.105
it, with no reload.

00:00:55.301 --> 00:01:00.341
A request nobody answered for a week offers cancel or ask again.

00:01:01.047 --> 00:01:07.092
Cancel request asks first. The business is told straight away, and Undo

00:01:07.092 --> 00:01:09.135
opens the request again.

00:01:10.454 --> 00:01:14.865
Behind the screen, the tests prove the owner is told in the app of a

00:01:14.865 --> 00:01:19.406
cancel and its withdrawal, and the request jobs run once per schedule.

00:01:20.288 --> 00:01:26.204
Journey fourteen is complete. Jubilee takes no payment: members pay the

00:01:26.204 --> 00:01:27.704
business directly.
